;THIS IS THE FIRST 126 RESIDUES OF THE FULL LENGTH OF 184 RESIDUES NATURALLY OCCURRING IN HUMANS. THE 126 RESIDUE RECOMBINANT N-TERMINAL DOMAIN LACKS THE NATURAL N-LINKED GLYCOSYLATION OF ASN30 AND ASN78.
